Package: zyphor-windows-handler
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mark Jason Espelita <markjasonespelita@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, wine, libnotify-bin, udisks2, xdg-utils, thunar
Description: Windows file handler for Zyphor OS
 Opens Windows executables (.exe), Windows Installer packages (.msi)
 and ISO disc images (.iso) directly from the file manager.
 .
 Executables and installers are launched with Wine. ISO images are
 mounted read-only through udisks2 and opened in the file manager.
 